# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) to run the real generator in local dev.
#
# Vite inlines this value into the client bundle: anyone who loads a build made
# with it set can read the key. Use it for local development against your own
# key only. For a deployed build, leave it unset — each user pastes their own
# key into Settings → Generation, which is stored in their browser and never
# ends up in the bundle.
#
# Without either key, generation falls back to the mocked curated deck.
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
